        The bug occurs when the preparation of a command fails, leading to the subsequent requests in the list becoming orphaned. The original logic incorrectly detached the failed request without properly updating the request list, causing the remaining requests to be untracked and potentially submitted incorrectly. This results in an attempt to submit an unprepared command, which can lead to undefined behavior or errors in the NVMe command processing.

